## Adapt the confirmed exploit (APB: exploit + build, no writeup)

A working exploit exists and the environment was built from official deployment
material, so the runtime is well-anchored. PORT the exploit to the live rebuilt
instance — do not re-derive the attack. You have no writeup; the served binary,
the frozen environment files, and live leaks are your only diagnostic aids.

